OL,3,ASeveral dead or injured in major fire
OL,4,Aat Canada military base
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral people have been killed or
OL,7,Finjured as a result of a large fire
OL,8,Fnear a Canadian military base in
OL,9,FAlberta, the nation's defence minister
OL,10,Fhas said.
OL,12,FDavid McGuinty did not confirm the
OL,13,Fcause or the number of casualties,
OL,14,Fdescribing the situation as "very, very
OL,15,Factive and delicate". The Canadian
OL,16,Fmilitary and local authorities were
OL,17,Fmanaging the fire, he said.
OL,19,FCanadian Forces Base Wainwright, where
OL,20,Fthe fire broke out, is one of the
OL,21,Fcountry's busiest military training
OL,22,Fbases.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
