OL,3,ASeveral dead or injured in major fire
OL,4,Aat Canada military base
OL,5,
OL,6,FCanadian TV network Global News
OL,7,Freported that at least seven were
OL,8,Fkilled and dozens more injured when a
OL,9,Fgas line or gas well was hit during a
OL,10,Flive-fire training exercise, citing
OL,11,Funnamed military sources.
